      "text": "in GP",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "R6jkO",
      "text": "consecutive integers",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Here, $225=3^{2} \\times 5^{2}$\r\n$\\Rightarrow d(225)=3 \\times 3=9$\r\n$1126=3^{2} \\times 5^{3}$\r\n$\\Rightarrow \\quad d(1125)=3 \\times 4=12$\r\nand $640=2^{7} \\times 5$\r\n$\\Rightarrow \\quad d(640)=8 \\times 2=16$\r\nHence, 9,12 and 16 are in GP.",
